  "description": "After guiding his 10,000th soul, Kai the reaper asks Shinos, the God of Death, to erase his very existence. But rather than meeting his end, Kai awakens in the body of Seian, the disgraced second son of House Shureyton. Forced to live a twisted life of regret and buried secrets, Kai must confront a past that isn’t his and find a way to rewrite a fate never meant to be. Can this once unfeeling reaper find redemption, or will his lesson in humanity end in destruction?\n\n(Source: Tapas)",
